Architecture
The platform maintains its hybrid approach:

Non-custodial Compute: User wallets control AI inference operations via 0G SDK
Custodial Storage: Server manages storage operations for UX optimization
All changes are minimal and surgical, focusing on fixing existing functionality rather than major refactoring. The environment variables in .env.local are properly configured and accessible in both Next.js client and API routes.

Testing
The build succeeds without errors and the testing dashboard provides comprehensive validation of all implemented features. The logging chain now properly appears in both frontend and backend consoles when using non-custodial mode.

